WEBVTT

00:02.970 --> 00:04.060
Someone...

00:04.060 --> 00:06.100
Someone, tell me.

00:06.740 --> 00:08.240
What is love?

00:08.600 --> 00:10.070
Is it edible?

00:14.580 --> 00:16.210
What is love?

00:16.680 --> 00:18.590
It's painful.

00:19.490 --> 00:20.390
Someone...

00:22.280 --> 00:24.420
Someone, tell me what it is.

00:28.170 --> 00:30.310
What is love?

01:50.370 --> 01:52.830
A small house located in the Great Japanese Empire.

01:52.830 --> 01:56.400
There, you'll find a girl with twin-tails, a simple girl,

01:56.400 --> 01:59.590
and the one, the absolute, the unique god, Kyouka-sama!

02:16.940 --> 02:20.050
Â¥238 per carton of egg?!

02:20.050 --> 02:23.060
They're ripping us off just because this is a city.

02:31.420 --> 02:33.540
Mother, can I change the channel?

02:33.540 --> 02:36.510
Wait a moment. The good part is just starting.

02:36.510 --> 02:38.600
No fair, hogging the TV.

02:38.600 --> 02:41.930
Hyouka-chan. Can you give me
a hand bringing the laundry in?

02:41.930 --> 02:43.330
It looks like it's about to start pouring.

02:43.330 --> 02:44.050
Okay.

02:44.050 --> 02:46.130
Thank you. You're such a great help.

02:46.560 --> 02:48.690
Th-This is...

02:49.390 --> 02:51.250
Right! That's a useful trick!

02:50.310 --> 02:51.250
It's starting to pour.

02:51.250 --> 02:53.230
What? Starting to pour, you say?

02:59.580 --> 03:00.570
Kyouka.

03:01.070 --> 03:02.840
You came to pick me up?

03:02.840 --> 03:05.910
You forgot to take an umbrella with you, Mr. Forgetful.

03:06.480 --> 03:07.350
Thank you.

03:09.040 --> 03:10.860
What is that? It looks gross.

03:10.860 --> 03:14.290
Heaven's pretty thoughtful.

03:10.860 --> 03:12.090
It looks all slimy.

03:12.090 --> 03:13.860
It doesn't look like it belongs on Earth.

03:13.860 --> 03:14.830
I smell blood from it.

03:14.830 --> 03:17.210
Mom, do you think Dad's all right?

03:18.300 --> 03:22.850
Wait a bit, Ouka! I, the god, shall come pick you up!

03:22.850 --> 03:24.930
I expect more than just a kiss on the forehead.

03:24.930 --> 03:27.140
Well, a kiss on the forehead isn't that bad, but...

03:29.060 --> 03:32.780
Rain, rain, come down. Fall from the sky.

03:32.780 --> 03:36.090
Muggy and humidity make the wife happy.

03:36.090 --> 03:39.520
Drip drop trip trip woo whoo whoo.

03:41.610 --> 03:43.280
What the hell is this?

03:43.280 --> 03:45.460
It's no ordinary rain, Mom.

03:45.460 --> 03:46.450
It's simply dangerous.

03:46.450 --> 03:49.410
She's right. Rain's not the only thing that can start pouring from the sky.

03:49.410 --> 03:51.280
Isn't it usually rain that we expect?

03:49.800 --> 03:56.110
You! I was planning on picking up my hubby acting like a kind wife, and you just ruined my plan!

03:56.110 --> 03:57.800
And you stink horribly.

03:58.400 --> 03:59.340
Hold on.

03:59.340 --> 04:03.300
If I went to pick him up despite the danger I had to face...

04:03.300 --> 04:07.970
Even that slow Ouka would thank me
on his knees and give me a love-love hug.

04:06.930 --> 04:07.620
Kyouka.

04:07.970 --> 04:09.890
This is better than just a rain.

04:09.890 --> 04:12.100
No, no. That's unlikely.

04:13.270 --> 04:15.940
Long time no see, everyone.

04:15.940 --> 04:18.060
Hiratsuka Raichou?

04:18.060 --> 04:19.740
Where did you come from?!

04:19.740 --> 04:21.350
Trade secret.

04:21.350 --> 04:23.700
I happen to have a license for a truck crane.

04:23.700 --> 04:27.070
So this stinky ugly egg is your doing?!

04:27.070 --> 04:31.080
I'm always on your side. You wound me.

04:31.080 --> 04:33.750
You haven't forgotten about the beastmen case, have you?

04:33.750 --> 04:37.080
There also was a case where all humans turned into animals, too.

04:37.080 --> 04:40.090
She sure made us work.

04:40.090 --> 04:46.050
But this time, the Earth is in a great danger,
incomparable to those two incidents.

04:46.050 --> 04:47.550
Great danger?

04:47.550 --> 04:48.780
Yes.

04:48.780 --> 04:50.880
The expected doom.

04:50.880 --> 04:54.060
In other words, an invasion by aliens.

04:55.250 --> 04:57.020
Aliens?

05:02.650 --> 05:04.330
So many things happen these days.

05:04.900 --> 05:06.030
I guess I'll call home first.

05:10.260 --> 05:11.870
S-Something came falling from the sky!

05:18.620 --> 05:19.900
When did she...

05:24.030 --> 05:24.590
Alien?

05:28.460 --> 05:30.350
Um... Are you all right?

05:32.000 --> 05:35.770
Yes. It hurt a little, but no worries.

05:36.430 --> 05:40.190
Midarezaki Ouka from the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.530
Who might you be?

05:41.530 --> 05:42.670
I'm Oasis.

05:42.980 --> 05:49.290
Then, I'd like to get in contact with your kind to have them come pick you up, so would you-

05:49.290 --> 05:49.800
Hey!

05:50.160 --> 05:55.260
Ouka, why are you covering yourself with such a thin coating?

05:55.260 --> 05:56.410
C-Coating?

05:56.410 --> 05:59.250
I can't suck your bodily fluids like that.

05:59.250 --> 06:01.030
I'll bite through it!

06:01.030 --> 06:06.030
Hold on! If you bite, the skin will rip
and the bodily fluid called blood will come out!

06:06.030 --> 06:08.080
But letting out too much is dangerous.

06:08.080 --> 06:15.540
I see. So on this planet where water is scarce, you're protecting yourself by keeping it within the coating.

06:15.540 --> 06:19.120
It must be lonely to isolate oneself from the rest of the world.

06:16.990 --> 06:19.880
Her way of speaking and sense of rationalization...

06:19.120 --> 06:23.020
The people of this planet must have chosen to live loftily.

06:19.880 --> 06:21.660
It reminds me of someone.

06:24.340 --> 06:25.280
Ouka!

06:26.780 --> 06:31.280
This time, I want you all to settle the expected doom for us.

06:31.970 --> 06:35.820
You ask us to save the Earth not just once, but twice?

06:35.820 --> 06:40.580
Do you take our family as some group of heroes of justice?

06:40.580 --> 06:48.150
You think the god like me would help alien-busting after being ordered so highly and mightily?

06:48.150 --> 06:53.720
If you're going to say that, I'll have to fire Ouka-kun and take him off Operation Cozy Family.

06:53.720 --> 06:55.940
How could you! Is that a threat?!

06:55.940 --> 06:58.100
Kitty would never be daunted by a threat like that!

06:58.100 --> 06:59.140
Fine, we will.

07:00.210 --> 07:00.980
Why so simply?

07:02.700 --> 07:04.790
M-Mom?

07:04.790 --> 07:09.730
It's the wife's duty to share the pain and walk through the thorn bushes when the hubby's suffering.

07:10.550 --> 07:13.870
This is a great chance to make Ouka feel grateful toward me.

07:14.830 --> 07:23.240
This will make Ouka obey me, and I shall reign above him for the rest of his life!

07:14.830 --> 07:16.800
So is it settled?

07:16.800 --> 07:19.450
Thank you.

07:19.450 --> 07:21.400
She left without much explanation.

07:21.400 --> 07:23.240
I'm sure there's a catch.

07:23.240 --> 07:28.920
Oh right. The alien will look weak at a glance, but it's actually really strong.

07:28.920 --> 07:33.050
So don't start a fight and try to have it kindly leave.

07:33.050 --> 07:34.180
You've got it!

07:35.780 --> 07:38.100
Oasis-san! What are these monsters?!

07:38.100 --> 07:41.060
You scum! You're picking a fight with me?!

07:41.540 --> 07:43.020
They're not her kind?

07:43.020 --> 07:47.530
Could all of these meteorites be eggs?

07:52.760 --> 07:55.280
This isn't good. If it's come to this...

07:56.360 --> 07:57.280
We'll run!

08:00.090 --> 08:01.410
Run like you mean it!

08:02.730 --> 08:04.580
I can't run.

08:04.580 --> 08:05.710
What in the world?!

08:06.300 --> 08:07.210
Oh no!

08:10.790 --> 08:12.830
What is that thing that you've been using for a while?

08:12.830 --> 08:14.000
It's called a gun.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.850
A tool to kill living things.

08:16.400 --> 08:19.560
But it looks like it's ineffective against these monsters.

08:19.940 --> 08:25.430
I see. So you cooperate with the strong in order to strengthen your weaknesses.

08:27.230 --> 08:32.130
Then Ouka. There's no need for you to use a chunk of steel like that.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.890
W-What is this?

08:35.890 --> 08:37.400
Oasis Blade!

08:37.400 --> 08:39.250
If not, Oasis Sword!

08:39.250 --> 08:42.810
I kind of like the name Oasis Breaker, too.

08:42.810 --> 08:45.830
I think Oasis Breaker would
grammatically imply the wrong us-

08:48.490 --> 08:50.760
M-My body moved on its own.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.420
You foolish looking pieces of meat.

08:52.520 --> 08:55.340
Observe the strength of Oasis and Ouka!

08:55.340 --> 08:56.280
Block cut!

08:56.840 --> 08:58.080
Thin slice!

08:58.600 --> 09:03.360
Special move, Oasis Crusher!

09:09.410 --> 09:10.980
I think that's enough.

09:14.650 --> 09:18.380
How was it? That's the result when I get serious.

09:18.380 --> 09:20.120
Ouka, compliment me.

09:28.210 --> 09:29.150
Oasis-san!

09:29.150 --> 09:30.550
Are you all right?!

09:30.970 --> 09:32.650
Wa... wa...

09:32.650 --> 09:33.550
Worm?

09:33.550 --> 09:37.160
Get me... water...

09:37.160 --> 09:37.610
Water?

09:37.610 --> 09:38.510
Oh, water!

09:40.300 --> 09:41.150
Oasis-san.

09:45.900 --> 09:47.850
More water.

09:47.850 --> 09:48.720
Here.

09:48.720 --> 09:50.350
Dump it on me.

09:50.350 --> 09:51.480
Like this?

09:56.900 --> 09:58.320
Ah...

09:58.320 --> 10:00.100
Hey, Kyouka. Perfect timing.

10:00.100 --> 10:05.410
You're so late, so I came to pick you up myself...

10:05.410 --> 10:11.590
And what? Instead of a kiss
on the forehead for your cute wife...

10:11.590 --> 10:12.840
...I get this?!

10:15.930 --> 10:17.510
I'm refreshed.

10:23.710 --> 10:25.600
Kyouka, you got it wrong! She's-

10:25.600 --> 10:30.860
Ouka. I can't really differentiate the people
on this planet well, but I've committed you to memory.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.860
Wait! Let go of me!

10:31.860 --> 10:33.230
I see. I see.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.230
Kyouka, there is a reason behind this!

10:34.580 --> 10:35.360
K-Kyouka?

10:36.010 --> 10:41.120
Does Ouka wish to be stabbed by the umbrella?

10:41.770 --> 10:44.490
If you want to pour water on someone, why not me?!

10:43.770 --> 10:45.750
Time out! Stop!

10:44.490 --> 10:49.350
You're my hubby! So you should only be looking at me!

10:48.500 --> 10:50.350
It's only cute if it's said in the right situations!

10:50.350 --> 10:52.400
I said stop!

11:00.640 --> 11:02.070
What is this?

11:02.070 --> 11:03.950
U-Um... A cactus.

11:03.950 --> 11:05.000
What is this?

11:05.000 --> 11:06.680
U-Um... A refrigerator.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.870
What is this?

11:08.870 --> 11:10.800
Um... Um... A stereo.

11:13.740 --> 11:15.580
Are you simply all right?

11:17.110 --> 11:22.530
The weak-looking but strong alien
Hiratsuka-dono was speaking of must be her.

11:22.530 --> 11:26.790
If we send her back to space, the expected doom won't be an issue, right?

11:26.790 --> 11:29.290
But, what did she come here for in the first place?

11:29.290 --> 11:31.210
How about asking her?

11:32.970 --> 11:35.120
Oasis-chan, was it?

11:35.590 --> 11:37.120
You're an alien, right?

11:38.590 --> 11:39.280
I think.

11:41.060 --> 11:48.930
If "alien" means those who came from
another planet, then yes, I am an alien.

11:49.480 --> 11:53.180
What did you come to Earth for?

11:53.680 --> 11:55.040
What is love?

11:55.040 --> 11:57.610
I came to find that out.

11:57.610 --> 11:59.110
Love?

11:59.490 --> 12:01.220
L-Love?

12:03.740 --> 12:05.370
The expected doom?

12:05.370 --> 12:11.470
Wait. So Oasis-san is some unbelievable alien that brings terror to Earth,

12:11.470 --> 12:16.430
and you promised Raichou that you would persuade her to go home?

12:16.430 --> 12:17.880
That's what I said, wasn't it?

12:18.820 --> 12:20.900
Why did you accept such a thing?

12:20.900 --> 12:23.280
We already have strange eggs falling to earth outside.

12:24.540 --> 12:25.340
Because...

12:25.710 --> 12:26.930
Because what?

12:27.600 --> 12:31.520
Because Raichou said she'd fire you if we don't do it.

12:32.600 --> 12:36.930
And she even said she'd remove you from Operation Cozy Family.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.360
So I couldn't help it.

12:39.590 --> 12:41.190
Kyouka...

12:44.180 --> 12:46.450
Why the umbrella?

12:46.870 --> 12:47.950
Father!

12:49.040 --> 12:49.920
Mother?

12:50.680 --> 12:51.500
What's the matter?

12:51.500 --> 12:54.450
Look! Oasis-chan dried up all of a sudden.

12:53.650 --> 12:54.620
Water...

12:56.210 --> 13:00.050
So it looks like she needs to be hydrated constantly.

13:03.460 --> 13:04.970
I'm refreshed!

13:06.390 --> 13:08.280
Thank goodness, Oasis-san.

13:08.280 --> 13:10.970
In any case, it seems it's dangerous for you to stay on this planet for too long.

13:10.970 --> 13:12.980
It's probably best for you to return home as soon as you can.

13:12.980 --> 13:13.730
That's right.

13:14.250 --> 13:18.250
What is love? Teach me, Ouka.

13:18.250 --> 13:21.030
I've come to learn that.

13:24.050 --> 13:26.470
Mom's... Mom's...

13:27.280 --> 13:29.080
Mother, you have to resist.

13:29.080 --> 13:33.910
Oasis-chan came to Earth eager to learn what love is.

13:33.910 --> 13:36.170
She said she'll go back when she discovers what it is.

13:39.080 --> 13:43.810
Oasis-san. We'll teach you little by little regarding what love is, so let's go.

13:47.300 --> 13:49.970
I love you, Chika-chan.

13:49.970 --> 13:51.120
Ginichi-san...

13:51.470 --> 13:53.470
I've been waiting to hear those words all these days.

13:54.070 --> 13:55.110
Chika-chan.

13:55.110 --> 13:56.260
Ginichi-san.

13:57.850 --> 13:59.340
No, I can't!

13:59.340 --> 14:02.460
Even if it's just an act, I can't lie to my heart!

14:02.460 --> 14:03.640
I'm sorry, Chika-chan!

14:03.640 --> 14:07.620
I see. You hate me that much?

14:07.620 --> 14:09.910
You don't want to do it with me?

14:09.910 --> 14:13.610
If you hate me that much, then take this! Take this!

14:13.610 --> 14:15.200
Where's your sorry?

14:15.200 --> 14:16.320
I'm really sorry!

14:17.150 --> 14:20.320
It's rare for you to have an important talk.

14:20.320 --> 14:20.920
What is it?

14:21.440 --> 14:25.340
Madara. There's something I want to hear you say.

14:25.340 --> 14:26.960
What is love?

14:27.630 --> 14:29.220
I want you to teach it to Oasis-dono there.

14:30.060 --> 14:31.430
What is love?

14:32.030 --> 14:35.730
You're a female, so I figured you two would get along.

14:36.310 --> 14:38.980
You called me for something like that?

14:38.980 --> 14:40.910
Jerk! Shakuya, you jerk!

14:40.910 --> 14:42.370
Ow! Ow! You're hurting me!

14:43.460 --> 14:44.780
I see.

14:45.030 --> 14:46.360
I figured it out!

14:47.160 --> 14:49.530
To love is to hurt others, correct?

14:51.200 --> 14:53.110
This is what love is about!

14:54.710 --> 14:57.250
Mom. Dad's getting picked on.

14:57.250 --> 14:58.730
I don't like this.

14:58.730 --> 15:01.920
Look. I'm making love with Ouka!

15:01.920 --> 15:02.500
Come here.

15:02.500 --> 15:06.990
Only I, Kyouka-sama, have the right to hurt and play with Ouka!

15:06.500 --> 15:07.790
Please stop!

15:06.990 --> 15:09.560
No! This is my love!

15:09.560 --> 15:11.350
I want to be in love, too!

15:11.350 --> 15:14.720
This is my time to make love!

15:12.300 --> 15:14.720
This isn't what love is about!

15:16.780 --> 15:18.680
It isn't?

15:18.680 --> 15:20.730
You ruined her enlightenment.

15:20.730 --> 15:23.560
She would have gone back as long as
she thought she understood what love is.

15:23.560 --> 15:25.980
Our work has gone to waste.

15:27.350 --> 15:28.610
It was a long day.

15:29.560 --> 15:31.240
I've got to do something about this fast.

15:36.610 --> 15:39.330
So this is what people look like when they're naked.

15:39.330 --> 15:40.750
Very interesting.

15:40.750 --> 15:42.290
You saw?!

15:42.750 --> 15:44.650
Why are you running away?

15:44.650 --> 15:48.880
Being one with you, skin to skin, was very comfortable.

15:48.880 --> 15:51.720
That would make others think wrongly!

15:52.460 --> 15:53.300
No, Yuuka!

15:54.180 --> 15:55.010
Yuuka!

15:56.780 --> 15:58.720
What's wrong with Yuuka?

16:03.100 --> 16:04.520
So boring.

16:05.100 --> 16:08.230
Apparently humans have to sleep.

16:10.340 --> 16:13.720
Are monsters sleeping at night, too?

16:14.020 --> 16:15.780
Even the eggs won't come falling.

16:16.990 --> 16:23.100
On that planet, nobody would answer, leaving me all alone.

16:25.410 --> 16:26.550
It's cold.

16:28.590 --> 16:31.350
Ouka's skin was warm.

16:37.650 --> 16:41.020
Ouka. Is your sleep over?

16:42.100 --> 16:45.520
I'm amazed that his moisture isn't
going away, lying in a thing like this.

16:46.590 --> 16:49.360
Wake up. I'm bored.

16:50.230 --> 16:52.530
Ouka! Wake up!

16:52.530 --> 16:54.280
He won't wake up.

16:55.500 --> 16:59.450
If he is in danger of death, he'll have to wake up due to survival instinct.

17:08.500 --> 17:10.830
Um, um. What are you doing to Dad?

17:10.830 --> 17:12.010
What's going on?

17:12.010 --> 17:13.320
What?

17:13.940 --> 17:15.350
Unbelievable!

17:15.350 --> 17:16.890
Kids shouldn't look.

17:17.260 --> 17:21.750
Even Kyouka-sama hasn't done that yet.

17:22.230 --> 17:27.060
This? Yeah, endangering a life is a bad thing to do.

17:27.060 --> 17:31.960
But I couldn't think of a way to wake Ouka up other than sucking his bodily fluids out.

17:32.360 --> 17:33.800
You!

17:33.800 --> 17:35.360
I've reached the limits of my patience!

17:42.480 --> 17:46.210
Raichou! You just need us to take care of the expected doom, right?!

17:46.210 --> 17:49.250
Then I'll just kill this girl right here!

17:49.250 --> 17:52.760
You've said it. If you're going to pick a fight with me, then you have one!

17:54.760 --> 17:56.530
What is going on here?

17:58.610 --> 18:00.010
Something looks wrong with Oasis-san.

18:00.700 --> 18:02.060
She's having her attack again.

18:01.190 --> 18:02.060
Water...

18:02.270 --> 18:04.010
Oasis-san! I'll get you some water right now!

18:04.010 --> 18:04.770
Wait, Ouka!

18:06.580 --> 18:07.400
Kyouka.

18:09.530 --> 18:11.690
Do you want to save Oasis that badly?

18:12.290 --> 18:13.530
Please get out of my way.

18:13.530 --> 18:18.700
I'm telling you to either choose Oasis or this Kyouka-sama!

18:18.700 --> 18:22.580
What? She's an alien I only met a day or so ago!

18:22.580 --> 18:24.250
How do you expect me to compare you two?

18:24.250 --> 18:29.250
If we let her be, the expected doom will end without any more work.

18:29.250 --> 18:31.760
It works out great for us Midarezaki.

18:32.760 --> 18:33.670
Kyouka...

18:34.340 --> 18:36.420
I know I'm meddlesome.

18:37.160 --> 18:38.550
But I can't ignore her.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.470
Ouka.

18:42.960 --> 18:45.730
She sort of reminds me of you.

18:47.150 --> 18:48.510
Does she?

18:48.840 --> 18:49.980
Is that why?

18:50.980 --> 18:52.980
Then I guess it can't be helped.

18:53.430 --> 18:54.160
Water!

18:55.110 --> 18:56.110
Water's not coming out?!

18:56.510 --> 18:57.110
Water!

18:57.550 --> 18:57.990
Water!

18:57.990 --> 18:58.990
Water...

18:58.990 --> 19:00.070
Water!

19:00.590 --> 19:02.410
Who did such a thing?

19:03.240 --> 19:04.080
If it's water-

19:04.080 --> 19:04.500
Empty.

19:04.500 --> 19:04.990
It's gone!

19:04.990 --> 19:10.140
Ouka... I had fun...

19:10.940 --> 19:13.180
Oasis-san!

19:16.260 --> 19:17.550
I'm refreshed!

19:18.890 --> 19:20.730
I thought I was going to die there.

19:20.730 --> 19:22.930
You certainly were about to.

19:23.740 --> 19:26.350
Rather than that, the one who did this is...

19:27.850 --> 19:28.910
Yuuka, isn't it?

19:30.660 --> 19:33.400
How did you know, Dad?

19:34.010 --> 19:36.630
You were the only one who wasn't in the room.

19:37.460 --> 19:38.750
I'm sorry, Yuuka...

19:39.140 --> 19:43.160
It's fine. I'm not angry or anything.

19:43.160 --> 19:50.970
I know all men cheat and that it can't be helped.

19:51.620 --> 19:53.040
Yuuka, I'm not cheating.

19:53.040 --> 19:57.300
Do you understand your situation, Dad?

19:57.300 --> 20:00.470
I think you should restrain yourself a little more.

20:01.210 --> 20:02.300
Yuuka..

20:02.300 --> 20:05.840
Mom's... you know!

20:06.220 --> 20:10.060
She loves you very much!

20:10.060 --> 20:12.980
Gosh, Yuuka. Why did you have to go say that?

20:12.980 --> 20:15.370
So embarrassing.

20:12.980 --> 20:13.810
Love?

20:13.810 --> 20:16.430
Yuuka-chan, did you drink all that water?

20:15.370 --> 20:19.530
Yuuka-chan, you're so cute, so cute, so cute, so cute.

20:17.130 --> 20:20.890
Yup, all. Every bit of it.

20:19.530 --> 20:21.210
Do you want something, Yuuka-chan?

20:20.890 --> 20:23.240
You're the one that broke the faucets, too, aren't you?

20:21.210 --> 20:24.320
Pudding? Then I'll make some for you.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.770
I'm sorry.

20:25.770 --> 20:29.580
I'm sorry, Yuuka. Are you possibly not feeling well?

20:30.430 --> 20:35.470
Who do you think is responsible for me not feeling well?

20:35.470 --> 20:36.650
Oasis-san!

20:36.650 --> 20:38.090
W-What?

20:38.770 --> 20:40.410
You...

20:42.660 --> 20:47.040
You can't take Dad away.

20:50.800 --> 20:51.750
Water...

21:04.680 --> 21:06.610
"Don't take him away," she says.

21:06.610 --> 21:09.250
Does Ouka belong to Yuuka?

21:09.250 --> 21:12.250
Is that why she yelled at me?

21:12.820 --> 21:16.040
What is that emotion called?

21:17.280 --> 21:18.330
Love?

21:19.140 --> 21:20.570
This feeling that I'm experiencing...

21:22.660 --> 21:24.790
It... hurts...

21:31.490 --> 21:32.890
Oasis-san?

21:33.380 --> 21:35.110
Where did she go?

21:35.110 --> 21:37.740
You called and here I am! Tah-dah!

21:38.410 --> 21:41.110
That Oasis was way too weak.

21:41.110 --> 21:43.590
The expected doom is practically averted.

21:43.590 --> 21:49.080
Exactly. I forgot to tell you the name of the alien who will be responsible for the expected doom.

21:49.980 --> 21:52.000
His name is Gouyokuou.

21:52.000 --> 21:54.380
Sounds like a strong boy, right?

21:54.380 --> 21:55.600
Gouyokuou?

21:55.600 --> 21:56.880
Boy?

21:56.880 --> 21:59.680
He's actually really strong.

21:59.680 --> 22:02.950
But he appears weak, so don't let your guard down.

22:03.800 --> 22:05.910
Who's Oasis-san, by the way?

23:40.690 --> 23:42.190
This day has finally come.

23:42.190 --> 23:42.860
The expected doom.

23:42.860 --> 23:45.920
Then let's go, Ouka! Time to party! Time to bust the doom!

23:45.920 --> 23:48.950
Come on. Can't you take at least the climax seriously?

23:48.950 --> 23:50.940
Seriously. Okay, Dad.

23:50.940 --> 23:52.160
Voila!

23:52.210 --> 23:54.200
Next time: His name is Gouyokuou.
